{
  "about": "lib/sync.js applyDeltas at EQUAL rev for a printFiles record: what each device keeps when the incoming copy differs from the local one. Derived reader fields (colors, swapCount, swapsKnown, coloursReader, geometryReader, coloursUnreadBudget, coloursUnreadFile) are not an edit: a difference only there is never a conflict, and the higher reader's copy wins, then a full read over an over-budget one (coloursUnreadBudget/coloursUnreadFile), then the higher budget, then a stable compare. `keep` is 'incoming' or 'local'; `conflict` is whether a conflict is reported. Every app runs these through its engine.",
  "cases": [
